  "issue_conclusions": {
    "rcm": {
      "body": "The original owner can retain **BD-Difco** continuity: its creation history identifies MediaDive1769, whose captured uses name BD-Difco; current JCM481, 482 and 612 independently name BD-Difco RCM. Prepare a supplier-qualified local identity on that authentic owner. Keep the manufacturer nine-part approximate formulation scoped to its cited product/formula; do not infer more specific peptones, salt hydrates or invariant lot composition.\n\nThe NBRC902 occurrence explicitly naming **Oxoid CM0149** needs a separate, deduplicated supplier-specific owner. Its historical formula revision is unknown. The current Oxoid IFU's formula differs from the Difco table, and must not be backdated onto that old occurrence. Bare RCM and mixed-supplier alternatives remain unresolved; preserve all raw strings/history without globally routing generic aliases to either product. Additional water, agar and sea salts in receiving media are not automatically constituents of the purchased dry product. The existing Dehydrated_RCM_Medium scope must be checked during deduplication, not silently absorbed.\n\nSources: [MediaDive1769](https://mediadive.dsmz.de/ingredients/1769), [JCM481](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=481), [NBRC902](https://www.nite.go.jp/nbrc/catalogue/NBRCMediumDetailServlet?NO=902), [Oxoid IFU](https://assets.thermofisher.com/TFS-Assets/MBD/Instructions/MBD_BT_IFU-0539%20CM0149B%20REINFORCED%20CLOSTRIDIAL%20MEDIUM.pdf), [Difco/BBL manual excerpt](https://cdn.media.interlabdist.com.br/uploads/2021/01/Reinforced-Clostridial-Medium.pdf).\n\nIndependent full-owner scope review is recorded in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/existing-owner-scope-decisions-v1/`; decisions SHA256 `150af7315aa6688d4bc9adb3e2a27d0a0835ec8f8ac33d65b8951712b0382d81`, manifest `c664e35067692c0aa46c4570ec688ffba9281e692337cfa5de1e4f014dc2ce54`. The coordinator rehashed all 89 manifest members. This is a sourced conclusion for candidate preparation; final exact candidate bytes still require native validation and independent review. No maintained records or approvals have changed.\n",
      "id": 6718503364,
      "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/root-integration-findings-v1/issue1224-scope-conclusion-readback-v1.json",
